# Cloudbeds Dashboard — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev. Set the same vars in Vercel (Production +
# Preview). NEVER commit real values — .env*.local is gitignored.

# --- Cloudbeds (server-side only — NO NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix) ---
# The generated API key (starts with cbat_). The current key is Davenport-only.
# Header used: Authorization: Bearer <key>. Base URL: hotels.cloudbeds.com/api/v1.3.
CLOUDBEDS_API_KEY=cbat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# --- Access gate (Phase 5 — not yet wired) ---
# PIN that gates the public page (CLAUDE.md §5 rule 5). Server-checked, sets an
# httpOnly cookie. Add when the gate is implemented.
# DASHBOARD_PIN=000000
